# Vendored Metavision SDK installs, one per generation the backend-shim
# architecture builds against (see docs/BUILD_AND_USAGE.md, "Adding a new
# Metavision SDK generation backend") -- several GB each, not source, not
# meant to be committed. Naming convention: SDKs/<major><minor><patch>/,
# e.g. SDKs/511/ for Metavision SDK 5.1.1, laid out exactly like a normal
# Metavision installer's target directory (include/, lib/, bin/, ...).
/SDKs/

